    "citation": "Diener E, Wirtz D, Tov W, Kim-Prieto C, Choi D, Oishi S, Biswas-Diener R (2010). New well-being measures: short scales to assess flourishing and positive and negative feelings. Soc Indic Res, 97, 143-156.",
    "year": 2010
